  "All 11 SNPs are present here, including rs17026651 (3:30879358-C-G, nearest gene GADL1), which is absent from the UK Biobank (Neale) PheWeb.",
  "BioBank Japan carries the quantitative biomarkers the UK Biobank PheWeb release lacks: LDL-cholesterol, HDL-cholesterol, triglycerides, total cholesterol, glucose, HbA1c and BMI are all first-class traits, and 'HMG CoA reductase inhibitors' is a BBJ trait (ATC_C10AA) in its own right.",
  "Some traits are meta-analyses that include non-Japanese cohorts (Suzuki2024 type 2 diabetes by ancestry, Shirai2022 autoimmune / allergy, Sato2023 cancer). The Citation column distinguishes them from BBJ-only results.",
